      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:tkbweudpy6tvzjqdiza4z3p5/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzwrwn3vns2g",
      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "OK, this sounds like #AISafety I can get behind. #Liability is the one true aligning force. It aligns corporate interests with creating safe products. Cf the EU #AIAct.\n\n\"The AI ⁠safety regulator will be ​able to enforce significant penalties for AI companies doing the wrong thing.\"",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/markriedl.bsky.social/post/3mzwrwn3vns2g",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-10T06:13:13.137Z",
      "likes": 14,
